\pard\li720 **AI scaling limits**: Complexity Scaling. Large models have exponential training cost; diminishing returns after certain size.\par\pard
\pard\li720 **Economic crises**: Communication Bottleneck. Information asymmetry leads to market failures; no amount of policy fixes information propagation speed.\par\pard
\pard\li720 **Pandemic response delays**: Sequential Processing. Information → Decision → Action takes time; cannot compress below constraint.\par\pard
